{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Among the bushes</b> — trees." "<b>They bray</b> — like wild asses." "<b>Nettles</b> — from [the verse] 'his face is covered with חרולים' (Job 30:18), and it is wind." "<b>They gather</b> — from [the verse] 'and they were joined to the house of Jacob' (Isaiah 14:1): they gather and assemble."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:02.451351992Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}